# TM Companion project

This workspace (`git-terraforming-mars/terraforming-mars`) **is** the helper app for the Steam Terraforming Mars client.

- Local Java app that tails Unity `Player.log` and serves a second-screen UI
- Package: `dev.tmcompanion`
- Do not treat the Steam game install or `AppData\LocalLow\LuckyHammers\Terraforming Mars` as this project's source root; those are data/log locations only

Build and change the companion here. Fair-play rules always apply.
